- Starting and ending branch `integrate-network-text`. Checked with `git status --short --branch` and `git diff --check`. Existing modifications and untracked work were preserved. No analysis, figure production, staging, commit or push.
- No standalone TeX or Poppler executables were on PATH. Used the official portable Tectonic 0.17.0 in `%TEMP%\pnas-issue13-tectonic`, with its standard package cache. From `paper_simple`, ran `& "$env:TEMP/pnas-issue13-tectonic/tectonic.exe" --keep-logs --keep-intermediates --outdir output/pdf/issue13_build main.tex`. Tectonic ran XeTeX, BibTeX and xdvipdfmx. The [TeX log](../output/pdf/issue13_build/main.log), [BibTeX log](../output/pdf/issue13_build/main.blg), auxiliary files and six PyMuPDF page PNGs are in the ignored build folder.
